        "clip_id": "G00015_24_21_015",
        "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00015/G00015_24/G00015_24_21/G00015_24_21_015.wav",
        "speaker_id": "21",
        "text": "嗯，你变美了。",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "start_s": 26.75260682067023,
        "end_s": 27.66189220779059
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "G00015_24_20_016",
        "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00015/G00015_24/G00015_24_20/G00015_24_20_016.wav",
        "speaker_id": "20",
        "text": "哎呀，[laughing]真会说话。",
        "emotion": "happy",
        "start_s": 27.66189220779059,
        "end_s": 30.46382408281038
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "G00015_24_21_017",
        "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00015/G00015_24/G00015_24_21/G00015_24_21_017.wav",
        "speaker_id": "21",
        "text": "以前上学那会儿，我就觉得，你肯定以后是要去北京的。你看果然，你在北京十年了，对吧？",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "start_s": 30.46382408281038,
        "end_s": 36.19916941011578
      }
    ],
    "note": "Labels included for audit only; never supply history gold labels or target captions to the model. This example does not prove that context improves classification."
  },
  {
    "dialogue_id": "G00003_34",
    "split": "test",
    "target": {
      "clip_id": "G00003_34_02_016",
      "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00003/G00003_34/G00003_34_02/G00003_34_02_016.wav",
      "speaker_id": "02",
      "text": "哎是吗？",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "start_s": 47.14264601524158,
      "end_s": 47.80985117919207,
      "duration_s": 0.6671882086167801
    },
    "past": [
      {
        "clip_id": "G00003_34_13_011",
        "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00003/G00003_34/G00003_34_13/G00003_34_13_011.wav",
        "speaker_id": "13",
        "text": "这个最近我们店里面搞活动呢，[over/]然后[/over]充一千赠三百。",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "start_s": 28.49227483547986,
        "end_s": 35.1227562611648
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "G00003_34_13_013",
        "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00003/G00003_34/G00003_34_13/G00003_34_13_013.wav",
        "speaker_id": "13",
        "text": "你看高姐。",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "start_s": 36.90190303667849,
        "end_s": 38.13661145465795
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "G00003_34_13_015",
        "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00003/G00003_34/G00003_34_13/G00003_34_13_015.wav",
        "speaker_id": "13",
        "text": "这个正好今天搞活动比较大【over/】啊【/over】，正好你赶上了，所以说你看，真的你你看你这发质啊，特别好越来越好了。",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "start_s": 38.89169402291055,
        "end_s": 47.11660444065151
      }
    ],
    "note": "Labels included for audit only; never supply history gold labels or target captions to the model. This example does not prove that context improves classification."
  },
  {
    "dialogue_id": "G00003_50",
    "split": "test",
    "target": {
      "clip_id": "G00003_50_13_018",
      "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00003/G00003_50/G00003_50_13/G00003_50_13_018.wav",
      "speaker_id": "13",
      "text": "谁来顶？",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "start_s": 94.23303640948556,
      "end_s": 95.04098887282488,
      "duration_s": 0.8079591836734694
    },
    "past": [
      {
        "clip_id": "G00003_50_02_015",
        "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00003/G00003_50/G00003_50_02/G00003_50_02_015.wav",
        "speaker_id": "02",
        "text": "这不是你自己说了吗，路上颠簸你自己不注意点儿吗？你就不能绕路吗？那肯定就是你的问题[over/]啊[/over]，路上你才能搞成[over/]这样的[/over]。",
        "emotion": "angry",
        "start_s": 74.11702025927694,
        "end_s": 81.55012701769546
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "G00003_50_13_016",
        "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00003/G00003_50/G00003_50_13/G00003_50_13_016.wav",
        "speaker_id": "13",
        "text": "【over/】不是啊【/over】，你这路上颠簸，路上颠簸是路上颠簸。但是箱，当时装什么样我卸货也是什么样。",
        "emotion": "angry",
        "start_s": 80.7824215054276,
        "end_s": 89.64265488606137
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "G00003_50_02_017",
        "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00003/G00003_50/G00003_50_02/G00003_50_02_017.wav",
        "speaker_id": "02",
        "text": "我不管，现在这个赔偿，这个赔偿谁来顶？不是你的问题吗？",
        "emotion": "angry",
        "start_s": 89.67547308532122,
        "end_s": 94.23303640948556
      }
    ],
    "note": "Labels included for audit only; never supply history gold labels or target captions to the model. This example does not prove that context improves classification."
  },
  {
    "dialogue_id": "G00015_53",
    "split": "test",
    "target": {
      "clip_id": "G00015_53_21_017",
      "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00015/G00015_53/G00015_53_21/G00015_53_21_017.wav",
      "speaker_id": "21",
      "text": "对不起。",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "start_s": 131.44167537525823,
      "end_s": 132.32708508377323,
      "duration_s": 0.8854195011337869
    },
    "past": [
      {
        "clip_id": "G00015_53_21_013",
        "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00015/G00015_53/G00015_53_21/G00015_53_21_013.wav",
        "speaker_id": "21",
        "text": "我现在是想问，我还有弥补的机会吗？",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "start_s": 70.77548546476935,
        "end_s": 74.87961987835666
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "G00015_53_21_015",
        "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00015/G00015_53/G00015_53_21/G00015_53_21_015.wav",
        "speaker_id": "21",
        "text": "没事，我我不希望给你压力啊，你是，我会尊重你的想法。只是我觉得如果我不把这个说出来，我可能会遗憾一辈子。",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "start_s": 89.90033516869407,
        "end_s": 102.12940573100758
      },
      {
        "clip_id": "G00015_53_20_016",
        "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00015/G00015_53/G00015_53_20/G00015_53_20_016.wav",
        "speaker_id": "20",
        "text": "你早干嘛去了？早两年你不说呢？我等了你八年，你早干嘛去了？",
        "emotion": "sad",
        "start_s": 110.40538235942162,
        "end_s": 126.56709702452125
      }
    ],
    "note": "Labels included for audit only; never supply history gold labels or target captions to the model. This example does not prove that context improves classification."
  },
  {
    "dialogue_id": "G00015_19",
    "split": "test",
    "target": {
      "clip_id": "G00015_19_20_041",
      "audio_path": "Audio/wav/G00015/G00015_19/G00015_19_20/G00015_19_20_041.wav",
      "speaker_id": "20",
      "text": "没没有啊。",
      "emotion": "fearful",
      "start_s": 100.86099863771864,
      "end_s": 102.02406958017896,
      "duration_s": 1.163061224489796
